{"seq":1,"slug":"parent-child-order-model","title":"父单/子单数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/parent-child-order-model","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"父单-子单数据模型\">父单/子单数据模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-父单保存意图-子单承载事实\">核心概念：父单保存意图，子单承载事实</h2><p>拆单产生两种实体，它们的<strong>职责边界</strong>是整个第三章的地基。<strong>父单</strong>（parent order）保存买家的全部原始意图：买了哪些行项、各多少件、付了多少钱、寄到哪个地址、承诺什么时候到、用了哪张优惠券。<strong>子单</strong>（fulfillment order / shipment order）承载履约事实：从哪个仓发、发哪些行项、走哪条渠道、用哪个运单号、实际什么时候出库。</p>\n<p>这个划分的判据是「这个字段会不会因为履约过程而改变」。承诺到达日属于父单（它是买家与平台之间的约定，不因某个仓发得慢而改变）；实际出库时间属于子单（它是履约事实）。把承诺时间放到子单上会导致「每个仓各承诺一个时间」，买家看到的是碎片化的承诺；把实际出库时间放到父单上会导致父单无法记录多个不同的出库时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[父单 ParentOrder&lt;br/&gt;买家意图唯一] --&gt; B[子单 FulfillmentOrder 1&lt;br/&gt;仓 A / 渠道 X]&#10;  A --&gt; C[子单 FulfillmentOrder 2&lt;br/&gt;仓 B / 渠道 Y]&#10;  A --&gt; D[金额分摊 AmountAllocation&lt;br/&gt;优惠/运费/税]&#10;  B --&gt; E[子单行项]&#10;  C --&gt; F[子单行项]&#10;  E --&gt; G[运单号 / 出库时间]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; B&#10;  D --&gt; C&#10;  B --&gt; H[状态事件流]&#10;  C --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[父单状态投影&lt;br/&gt;见 子单状态聚合到父单]\">graph TD\n  A[父单 ParentOrder&lt;br/&gt;买家意图唯一] --&gt; B[子单 FulfillmentOrder 1&lt;br/&gt;仓 A / 渠道 X]\n  A --&gt; C[子单 FulfillmentOrder 2&lt;br/&gt;仓 B / 渠道 Y]\n  A --&gt; D[金额分摊 AmountAllocation&lt;br/&gt;优惠/运费/税]\n  B --&gt; E[子单行项]\n  C --&gt; F[子单行项]\n  E --&gt; G[运单号 / 出库时间]\n  F --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; B\n  D --&gt; C\n  B --&gt; H[状态事件流]\n  C --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[父单状态投影&lt;br/&gt;见 子单状态聚合到父单]</pre><p>图中 <code>AmountAllocation</code> 是独立实体而非父单上的几个字段，这个设计选择在下一节展开——它解决了「金额分摊规则变化后如何重算」的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型与关键约束\">数据模型与关键约束</h2><h3 id=\"核心表结构\">核心表结构</h3><p>跨境的父单/子单模型需要显式记录币种、贸易术语与申报信息，这些字段在国内场景里不存在但跨境场景里缺一不可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE parent_order (&#10;  parent_order_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  buyer_id          BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  destination_country CHAR(2)   NOT NULL,&#10;  destination_postal  TEXT      NOT NULL,&#10;  currency          CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  incoterm          TEXT        NOT NULL,     -- DDP / DAP / DPU ...&#10;  total_amount_minor BIGINT     NOT NULL,     -- 最小货币单位，避免浮点&#10;  promised_delivery_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,  -- 买家侧的承诺，不因子单变化&#10;  split_decision_id BIGINT      REFERENCES split_decision(decision_id),&#10;  status            TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE fulfillment_order (&#10;  fo_id             BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  parent_order_id   BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES parent_order(parent_order_id),&#10;  seq_no            SMALLINT    NOT NULL,     -- 同一父单内稳定序号&#10;  warehouse_id      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_id        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  importer_of_record TEXT       NOT NULL,     -- 清关主体，跨境必填&#10;  declared_value_minor BIGINT   NOT NULL,&#10;  declared_currency CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  billable_weight_g INTEGER     NOT NULL,&#10;  tracking_no       TEXT,&#10;  status            TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  shipped_at        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  created_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (parent_order_id, seq_no)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_fo_parent_status ON fulfillment_order (parent_order_id, status);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_fo_tracking ON fulfillment_order (tracking_no) WHERE tracking_no IS NOT NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parent_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_order_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  destination_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  destination_postal  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  incoterm          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- DDP / DAP / DPU ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 最小货币单位，避免浮点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promised_delivery_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 买家侧的承诺，不因子单变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  split_decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> split_decision(decision_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fulfillment_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fo_id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_order_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_order(parent_order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seq_no            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同一父单内稳定序号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importer_of_record </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 清关主体，跨境必填</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_value_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  billable_weight_g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tracking_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipped_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (parent_order_id, seq_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_fo_parent_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment_order (parent_order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_fo_tracking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment_order (tracking_no) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracking_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个建模决策值得说明。第一，金额一律用<strong>最小货币单位整数</strong>（<code>*_minor</code>）存储，不用浮点也不用定点小数——对账场景里任何舍入漂移都是事故。第二，<code>UNIQUE (parent_order_id, seq_no)</code> 是幂等写入的基础：重试时用同一个 <code>seq_no</code> 插入会被约束挡住，而不是产生重复子单。第三，<code>idx_fo_parent_status</code> 直接服务于状态聚合查询——父单状态由子单集合算出，这个索引决定了聚合的代价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金额分摊表\">金额分摊表</h3><p>金额分摊独立成表的好处是<strong>可重算</strong>。当分摊规则变化（例如从按原价改为按实付）或某个子单被取消需要重分配时，只需重算这张表，而不必改动父单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE amount_allocation (&#10;  alloc_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  parent_order_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  fo_id           BIGINT REFERENCES fulfillment_order(fo_id),&#10;  alloc_kind      TEXT   NOT NULL,   -- goods / freight / duty / discount / insurance&#10;  amount_minor    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  allocation_rule TEXT   NOT NULL,   -- 记录分摊基准：by_item_price / by_billable_weight&#10;  round_residual  INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- 取整残差归属标记&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (parent_order_id, fo_id, alloc_kind)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> amount_allocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  alloc_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fo_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment_order(fo_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  alloc_kind      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- goods / freight / duty / discount / insurance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocation_rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 记录分摊基准：by_item_price / by_billable_weight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  round_residual  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取整残差归属标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (parent_order_id, fo_id, alloc_kind)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>alloc_kind</code> 用枚举而不是把运费税负塞进商品金额，是为了让财务能按科目归集——跨境场景里商品价值、运费、关税、增值税在账上属于不同科目，混在一起会导致收入确认与税务申报都做不了。<code>round_residual</code> 标记哪一票承接了取整残差，这是 <a href=\"../split-optimization/cross-border-tax-freight-recalc\">拆单后跨境税费/运费重算</a> 中最大余额法在数据模型上的落点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"必须成立的两个不变式\">必须成立的两个不变式</h3><p>模型层面有两条不变式，它们应该被写成<strong>周期性校验任务</strong>而不只是文档约定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不变式</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金额守恒</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>fo</mtext></msub><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>kind</mtext></msub><mtext>amount</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>parent.total</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{\\text{fo}} \\sum_{\\text{kind}} \\text{amount} = \\text{parent.total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kind</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parent.total</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>财务对账缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量守恒</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>fo</mtext></msub><mtext>qty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>parent.qty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{\\text{fo}} \\text{qty}(sku) = \\text{parent.qty}(sku)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parent.qty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多发货或少发货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>金额守恒的校验必须包含<strong>取整残差</strong>：允许差额不超过「子单数 × 最小货币单位」，超出即告警。数量守恒则必须严格为零差额，任何非零值都意味着真实的履约错误（除非该行项被标记为已取消并在父单侧同步扣减）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行项分配的两种表示\">行项分配的两种表示</h2><h3 id=\"父单行项-子单行项的映射\">父单行项 → 子单行项的映射</h3><p>一个父单行项「SKU A × 3 件」可能被拆成「子单 1 有 2 件、子单 2 有 1 件」。这个映射有两种表示方式，选择哪一种影响后续所有查询的复杂度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方式</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接拆分</td>\n<td>子单行项记录原始行项 ID 与数量</td>\n<td>查询简单，聚合快</td>\n<td>部分取消时需重新分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配记录</td>\n<td>单独一张 <code>line_allocation</code> 记录 (parent_line, fo, qty)</td>\n<td>可追溯、可重算</td>\n<td>多一次 join</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐<strong>分配记录</strong>方式，因为跨境场景下部分取消与再平衡（见 <a href=\"../split-fulfillment-ops/split-rebalance-stockout\">缺货时拆单再平衡</a>）发生频率高，直接在子单行项上改数量会让历史失真——你无法回答「这 1 件最初是分配给哪个仓的」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;parent_line_id&quot;: 4471,&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;SKU-A&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ordered_qty&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;allocations&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;fo_id&quot;: 9001, &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;US-LAX-01&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 2, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;reserved&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;fo_id&quot;: 9002, &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;US-EWR-02&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 1, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;reserved&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;unallocated_qty&quot;: 0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parent_line_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4471</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ordered_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"allocations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fo_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fo_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9002</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-EWR-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserved\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unallocated_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unallocated_qty</code> 是一个必须显式存在的字段。拆单决策时如果某行项无法完全分配（库存不足或候选仓都不满足硬约束），剩余量必须记在这里并触发缺货流程，而不是让父单行项与分配之和不等。把「缺口」显式化，是让系统在异常时不静默失真的关键手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态字段的语义划分\">状态字段的语义划分</h2><p>子单上会有多个看起来都是「状态」的字段，它们的语义必须严格区分，否则聚合逻辑会混乱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>取值示例</th>\n<th>更新者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>履约作业状态</td>\n<td>OPEN / IN_PROGRESS / CLOSED</td>\n<td>履约系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>request_status</code></td>\n<td>与三方仓的请求状态</td>\n<td>SUBMITTED / ACCEPTED / REJECTED</td>\n<td>请求-应答流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>payment_state</code></td>\n<td>该子单金额的结算状态</td>\n<td>PENDING / SETTLED / REFUNDED</td>\n<td>资金系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工业界的成熟实践中，履约单对象确实把这两类状态分开：以 Shopify 的 FulfillmentOrder 为例，<code>status</code> 使用的是 <code>OPEN</code>、<code>SCHEDULED</code>、<code>ON_HOLD</code>、<code>IN_PROGRESS</code>、<code>CLOSED</code> 这一组值描述履约工作本身，而独立的 <code>requestStatus</code> 使用 <code>SUBMITTED</code>、<code>ACCEPTED</code>、<code>CANCELLATION_REQUESTED</code>、<code>CANCELLATION_REJECTED</code> 描述商户与履约服务之间的请求往来（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/FulfillmentOrder\">Shopify FulfillmentOrder</a>）。另外，该 API 把「位置」建模为独立的 <code>assignedLocation</code> 对象而非订单上的一个字符串字段，并通过 <code>supportedActions</code> 暴露当前状态下允许的动作——这两个设计都值得借鉴：<strong>位置是带属性的对象</strong>（它有服务范围、承运能力、时区），<strong>允许的动作由状态推导而非由调用方自行判断</strong>。</p>\n<p><code>supportedActions</code> 这个模式对拆单系统特别有价值。它把「当前状态下能做哪些操作」的判定集中到服务端一处，避免了多个调用方各自实现状态判断导致的不一致——尤其在再平衡场景里，「这个子单现在能不能改派」是一个容易判错的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>父单保存买家意图</strong>（行项、金额、地址、承诺时间），<strong>子单承载履约事实</strong>（仓、渠道、运单号、出库时间）；判据是「该字段会不会因履约过程改变」。</li>\n<li>金额一律用<strong>最小货币单位整数</strong>存储；<code>UNIQUE (parent_order_id, seq_no)</code> 是幂等写入的基础。</li>\n<li>金额分摊<strong>独立成表</strong>（<code>amount_allocation</code>），按科目（goods / freight / duty / discount）归集，使规则变化时可重算而不动父单。</li>\n<li>两条不变式必须周期性校验：<strong>金额守恒</strong>（含取整残差容差）与<strong>数量守恒</strong>（零容差）。</li>\n<li>行项到子单的映射用<strong>分配记录</strong>而非直接拆分，以便部分取消与再平衡时保留历史。</li>\n<li><code>unallocated_qty</code> 必须显式存在，让库存缺口不静默失真。</li>\n<li>区分多组状态字段：<code>status</code>（履约作业）、<code>request_status</code>（三方请求）、<code>payment_state</code>（资金结算），并让<strong>允许的动作由状态推导</strong>（<code>supportedActions</code> 模式）而非调用方判断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"父单/子单数据模型","id":"父单-子单数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：父单保存意图，子单承载事实","id":"核心概念-父单保存意图-子单承载事实"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型与关键约束","id":"数据模型与关键约束"},{"level":3,"text":"核心表结构","id":"核心表结构"},{"level":3,"text":"金额分摊表","id":"金额分摊表"},{"level":3,"text":"必须成立的两个不变式","id":"必须成立的两个不变式"},{"level":2,"text":"行项分配的两种表示","id":"行项分配的两种表示"},{"level":3,"text":"父单行项 → 子单行项的映射","id":"父单行项-子单行项的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"状态字段的语义划分","id":"状态字段的语义划分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拆单后跨境税费/运费重算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-optimization/cross-border-tax-freight-recalc"},"next":{"title":"分仓并发预留与合单窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/parallel-reserve-merge-window"}}